  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Secondment to the Directorate-                    General Enlargement, European Commission in       Brussels 2011-2013 - Secondment to the Directorate-General Enlargement</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sekondering till generaldirektoratet               f&#xf6;r utvidgningsfr&#xe5;gor vid Europeiska Kommissionen i Bryssel 2011-2013</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Secondment of a fully financed national exepert, Erik Illes, to       Directorate-General Enlargement, Civil Society Facility. Erik will    work with the Civil Society Facility that covers the Western balkans  region and Turkey and be a link between the Commssion and Sida for    increased coordination regarding civil society support.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sekondering av fullfinansierad nationell expert, Erik Illes, till     Generaldirektoratet f&#xf6;r utvidgningsfr&#xe5;gor (DG Enlargement), Civil     Society Facility. Erik ska arbeta med civilsamh&#xe4;llesfaciliteten som   t&#xe4;cker hela V&#xe4;stra balkan och Turkiet samt vara en l&#xe4;nk mellan KOM    och Sida f&#xf6;r &#xf6;kad samordning kring civilsamh&#xe4;llesfr&#xe5;gor.</narrative>
  </description>
